INSERT INTO "NotificationTemplate" ("id", "event", "channel", "subject", "body", "active", "heading", "ctaLabel", "ctaLink", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES ('nt_' || md5('NV_PARTIAL_APPROVAL/EMAIL'), 'NV_PARTIAL_APPROVAL', 'EMAIL', 'Visa approval update for your booking — {{booking_id}}', 'Hi {{customer_name}},

A visa decision has been recorded for some passengers in your booking.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Approved passengers:
{{approved_passenger_names}}
Other passenger outcomes:
{{other_passenger_outcomes}}

This approval applies only to the passengers listed as approved. It does not mean every passenger has been approved.

You can also download available visa files from your TripNexio account.

Important: Please verify the visa details against the passport carefully. Report any spelling errors, incorrect visa type, or discrepancies to TripNexio within 24 hours of receiving this email for correction, where applicable. TripNexio will not be responsible for travel disruptions or related issues arising from discrepancies not reported within this period.

Important Travel Instructions:
• Check that all passenger and travel details are correct.
• Carry your original passport and all required travel documents.
• Check your flight status and reach the airport at least 3 hours before departure.
• Arrive at the designated reporting point at the specified reporting time.
• Ensure you meet all applicable visa, immigration, and border requirements. If additional documents are requested by immigration authorities, you must provide them.

Disclaimer: Visa approval and entry are subject to the relevant authorities. TripNexio does not guarantee approval, boarding, or entry. If you miss your scheduled flight or transport, the booking is non-refundable. If the airline or transport provider cancels the service, TripNexio will try to arrange an alternative; if none is available, a refund will be processed according to the applicable policy.

Please review all details carefully to help avoid last-minute issues.
Have a safe and pleasant journey with TripNexio!', true, 'Visa approved for some applicants', 'View Approved Visas', 'visa_download_url', now(), now())
ON CONFLICT ("event", "channel") DO NOTHING;

